  "tabs": {
    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "井眼轨迹是三维空间里的一条曲线。钻头本身不会拐弯，能让它拐弯的是"工具面角"——滑动钻进时钻柱朝向哪个方向，井眼就往哪个方向偏。控制目标不是走直线，而是在靶区窗口内少走弯路。这个案例的核心不是"把轨迹算准"，而是"用多少次纠偏换来的准"。",
      "judge": [
        { "label": "任务类型", "value": "预测控制 / 优化", "desc": "在约束下求工具面与滑动长度" },
        { "label": "数据门槛", "value": "随钻测量 + 工具面", "desc": "每 10—30 m 一个测点" },
        { "label": "可见收益", "value": "靶区命中率 ↑", "desc": "减少纠偏与滑动进尺" },
        { "label": "难度", "value": "高", "html": "<span class='dtag' data-d='高'>难度 高</span>", "desc": "闭环涉安全，目前多停在建议层" }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>定向井的轨迹控制靠三件事：<b>测斜</b>（每 10—30 m 测一次井斜与方位）、<b>调整工具面</b>（决定往哪拐）、<b>决定滑动还是旋转</b>（滑动能造斜但慢，旋转钻得快但不控方向）。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='井眼轨迹剖面与工具面角'><rect width='620' height='250' fill='#ffffff'/><line x1='40' y1='24' x2='40' y2='216' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><line x1='40' y1='216' x2='420' y2='216' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><line x1='40' y1='70' x2='420' y2='70' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><line x1='40' y1='120' x2='420' y2='120' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><line x1='40' y1='170' x2='420' y2='170' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><line x1='140' y1='24' x2='140' y2='216' stroke='#f4f1e9'/><line x1='240' y1='24' x2='240' y2='216' stroke='#f4f1e9'/><line x1='340' y1='24' x2='340' y2='216' stroke='#f4f1e9'/><text x='34' y='28' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>垂深</text><text x='420' y='230' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>水平位移 →</text><path d='M70 26 C70 90 100 160 200 180 C260 192 320 198 360 200' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><polyline points='70,26 74,50 69,74 78,96 73,118 86,138 79,158 96,172 92,186 112,192 108,200 135,204 140,198 165,206 172,200 200,207 210,201 240,208 252,202 285,207 298,201 330,205 345,200 360,202' fill='none' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linejoin='round'/><rect x='342' y='182' width='46' height='30' rx='3' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.55'/><text x='340' y='176' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51' font-weight='600' text-anchor='end'>靶区窗口</text><text x='80' y='40' font-size='8.2' fill='#2f7d6b' font-weight='600'>设计轨迹</text><text x='80' y='54' font-size='8.2' fill='#b26a39' font-weight='600'>实钻轨迹</text><text x='80' y='74' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9'>锯齿 = 反复纠偏</text><circle cx='520' cy='102' r='44' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><circle cx='520' cy='102' r='32' fill='none' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><text x='520' y='52' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>上</text><text x='572' y='106' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>右</text><text x='520' y='158' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>下</text><text x='468' y='106' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>左</text><line x1='520' y1='102' x2='499' y2='88' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='2.2'/><circle cx='520' cy='102' r='3' fill='#b26a39'/><circle cx='499' cy='88' r='2.4' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='520' y='172' font-size='8.6' fill='#8e5229' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>工具面角 50°</text><text x='520' y='186' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>决定往哪拐</text><text x='520' y='26' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>TOOLFACE</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左侧是轨迹剖面：<b>设计轨迹是光滑的，实钻轨迹是锯齿的</b>，每一道锯齿都是一次"偏了再纠"。右侧是工具面盘：指针指向哪，井眼就往哪偏。</p><p>锯齿不只是难看：每一次纠偏都增加井眼曲率（<b>狗腿度</b>），带来额外摩阻、起下钻困难，甚至影响后期下套管。所以轨迹控制真正要优化的是"总曲率"，不是"某一点的偏差"。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 150' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='旋转与滑动的效率对比'><rect width='620' height='150' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>ROTATE vs SLIDE · 相对机械钻速</text><text x='160' y='42' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>旋转钻进</text><rect x='168' y='33' width='352' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.88'/><text x='528' y='42' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>快，但不控方向</text><text x='160' y='76' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>滑动钻进</text><rect x='168' y='67' width='134' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.88'/><text x='310' y='76' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>能造斜，进尺慢</text><text x='160' y='110' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>滑动占比（典型）</text><rect x='168' y='101' width='106' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#9ba3a9' fill-opacity='.88'/><text x='282' y='110' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>30% 进尺 · 占钻时 45%</text><text x='0' y='140' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>滑动的效率只有旋转的三分之一左右。轨迹控制的本质，是用尽量少的滑动换来尽量准的落点</text></svg>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>把控制问题写成"滚动时域优化"：每次测得新姿态后，用井下响应模型预测未来几十米，在约束下求最优工具面与滑动长度，<b>执行一段再重算</b>。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 122' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='轨迹控制的五个环节'><rect width='620' height='122' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='18' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01 · MEASURE</text><text x='18' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>测斜</text><text x='18' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>井斜 / 方位</text><text x='18' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>每 10—30 m</text><path d='M121 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M129 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#41699b'/><text x='141' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02 · ESTIMATE</text><text x='141' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>姿态估计</text><text x='141' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>插值 + 区间</text><text x='141' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>狗腿度</text><path d='M244 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M252 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='264' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03 · MODEL</text><text x='264' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>地层响应</text><text x='264' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>工具面→造斜率</text><text x='264' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>按井段辨识</text><path d='M367 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M375 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='387' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>04 · MPC</text><text x='387' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>滚动优化</text><text x='387' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>预测 3—5 立柱</text><text x='387' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>约束靶区 / DLS</text><path d='M490 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M498 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='510' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>05 · ACT</text><text x='510' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>下发建议</text><text x='510' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>工具面 + 滑动长度</text><text x='510' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>可执行的数</text><text x='310' y='114' font-size='8.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>输出的是"这一柱怎么滑"，不是"整口井怎么打"——滚动优化的价值在于能纠偏</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　第 3 步是全部难点：同样的工具面，在砂岩和泥岩里造斜率不一样，而且<b>打之前不知道是哪种</b>。第 4 步的价值不在"算得准"，而在"算错了也能改"。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style='margin-bottom:14px'>轨迹控制的数据特点是<b>姿态稀疏、参数密集</b>：姿态十几米才一个点，钻井参数每秒都有。两者的时间尺度差四个数量级——这是"多源融合"要面对的现实。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='轨迹控制各类数据的采样频次'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>SAMPLING · 姿态稀疏，参数密集</text><line x1='106' y1='22' x2='106' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='106' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1s</text><line x1='222' y1='22' x2='222' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='222' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1m</text><line x1='339' y1='22' x2='339' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='339' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1h</text><line x1='429' y1='22' x2='429' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='429' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1d</text><line x1='526' y1='22' x2='526' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='526' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>30d</text><text x='98' y='38' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>钻井参数</text><line x1='106' y1='34' x2='152' y2='34' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='106' cy='34' r='2.4' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='534' y='38' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1—5 s</text><text x='98' y='62' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>随钻测量</text><line x1='308' y1='58' x2='339' y2='58' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='308' cy='58' r='2.4' fill='#41699b'/><text x='534' y='62' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>10—30 m</text><text x='98' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>工具面 / 滑动</text><line x1='288' y1='82' x2='319' y2='82' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='288' cy='82' r='2.4' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='534' y='86' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>按立柱</text><text x='98' y='110' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>设计靶区</text><circle cx='429' cy='106' r='2.8' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='534' y='110' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>单井一次</text><text x='98' y='134' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>地层 / 邻井</text><circle cx='339' cy='130' r='2.8' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='534' y='134' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>单井一次</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　测点之间是<b>插值</b>出来的，而插值误差会直接变成控制误差。这就是为什么轨迹控制必须带不确定性，而不是给一条确定的线。</p><p style='margin-top:12px'><b>数据准备清单</b></p><p>· <b>随钻测量轨迹</b>：井斜、方位、深度的测点序列，无需标注<br>· <b>工具面与滑动记录</b>：按立柱记录的工具面角与滑动长度，作为<b>动作标签</b><br>· <b>钻井参数</b>：钻压、转速、排量，高频，用于判断工况<br>· <b>地层与邻井</b>：地层倾角、邻井轨迹，作为扰动因素</p><p><b>最容易被忽略的一条</b>　"工具面与滑动记录"是唯一的动作标签。<b>没有它，就只能学"轨迹长什么样"，学不到"为什么长这样"</b>——后者才能指导下一柱怎么打。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px'><span class='dtag' data-d='高'>难度 高</span><span style='font-size:12px;color:#79828a'>算法不是瓶颈，井下响应辨识与安全责任才是。</span></div><svg viewBox='0 0 620 172' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='难度分解'><rect width='620' height='172' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY HARD · 难度来自哪一项</text><text x='102' y='36' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>数据可得性</text><rect x='110' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='36' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>测点稀疏，中间靠插值</text><text x='102' y='61' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>模型辨识</text><rect x='110' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='61' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>地层响应随井段变</text><text x='102' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>闭环风险</text><rect x='110' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='86' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>自动送钻责任重大</text><text x='102' y='111' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>可解释性</text><rect x='110' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='111' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>需说明为什么这样滑</text><rect x='110' y='128' width='300' height='1' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='110' y='146' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>两项 3 格：适合先做"建议"再谈"闭环"</text><text x='418' y='36' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>难度分级</text><rect x='418' y='44' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='53' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>低</text><rect x='418' y='60' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='69' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>中</text><rect x='418' y='76' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='85' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>高</text><text x='418' y='118' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>三条路线</text><text x='418' y='133' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>① 建议模式（先做）</text><text x='418' y='146' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>② 半自动（限幅）</text><text x='418' y='159' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>③ 全自动（暂不）</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　这类问题适合<b>先做"建议"再谈"闭环"</b>：把工具面与滑动长度算准，已经能省掉大量试错。全自动送钻不是技术问题，是责任问题。</p><p><b>技术路线建议</b>　模型预测控制（MPC）比端到端强化学习更现实：它需要的是一个<b>可辨识的响应模型</b>，而不是一个黑箱策略——前者错了能查，后者错了只能重训。</p><p><b>可借鉴的通用技术</b>　模型预测控制 · 系统辨识 · 模仿学习 · 状态估计</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "en": "WHAT · WHY · HOW",
          "title": "AI 方法拆解：用了什么、为什么、怎么起作用",
          "html": "<p>这个案例最能说明一件事：<b>不是所有问题都该交给强化学习</b>。当你能测量、能建模、能重算时，经典控制 + 少量学习反而更稳。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 230' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='WHAT WHY HOW 三联'><rect width='620' height='230' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='6' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='18' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHAT · 用了什么</text><text x='18' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>MPC + 系统辨识</text><text x='18' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>两个部件，各管一件事：</text><text x='18' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>① 响应模型（工具面→造斜率）</text><text x='18' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>② 滚动优化（每柱重算）</text><rect x='18' y='98' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.1' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='47' y='114' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01</text><text x='47' y='130' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>辨识</text><rect x='82' y='98' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='111' y='114' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02</text><text x='111' y='130' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>预测</text><rect x='146' y='98' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#f8ecdf' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='175' y='114' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03</text><text x='175' y='130' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>只执行首段</text><text x='18' y='162' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>不是端到端策略网络，因为策略网络</text><text x='18' y='176' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>错了无法归因。这两个部件可以</text><text x='18' y='190' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>分别验收——这是它的好处。</text><text x='18' y='212' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>"只执行首段"是 MPC 的核心</text><rect x='212' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='224' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY · 为什么</text><text x='224' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>地层不是一个常数</text><text x='224' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>同一工具面在砂岩与泥岩里造斜率</text><text x='224' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>不同，而且打之前不知道是哪种。</text><text x='224' y='96' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>开环偏差</text><rect x='232' y='87' width='112' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='352' y='96' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>14.0°</text><text x='224' y='122' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>滚动偏差</text><rect x='232' y='113' width='17' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='258' y='122' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>2.1°</text><text x='224' y='150' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>开环假设"下 8.8° 就真转 8.8°"。</text><text x='224' y='164' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>当地层只响应 65%，误差会沿井段</text><text x='224' y='178' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>逐段累加，而开环没有任何机制能发现它。</text><text x='224' y='204' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>同理，响应 130% 时会过早打平，</text><text x='224' y='217' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>结果"打浅了"——同样是不可逆的。</text><rect x='418' y='6' width='196' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='430' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>HOW · 怎么起作用</text><text x='430' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>用反馈抵消未知</text><text x='430' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>每段测斜后做三件事：</text><rect x='430' y='68' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 74 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='78' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>用实测姿态更新状态</text><rect x='430' y='88' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 94 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='98' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>用"实测/预测"更新响应估计</text><rect x='430' y='108' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 114 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='118' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>重算剩余段，只执行第一段</text><text x='430' y='144' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>结果：误差不会累积，只会被吸收。</text><text x='430' y='158' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>代价是每段多算一次——在钻井里</text><text x='430' y='172' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>这个代价可以忽略。</text><rect x='430' y='184' width='172' height='30' rx='5' fill='#f9efd7' stroke='#a97a1c' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='197' font-size='7.8' fill='#7d5a12'>但闭环救不了"工具做不到"</text><text x='440' y='209' font-size='7.8' fill='#7d5a12'>——它只能救"不知道"。</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左：用了什么。中：为什么非它不可。右：它凭什么有用，以及它的边界在哪。<b>最后那条"救不了工具做不到"，是这个案例最该记住的一句</b>。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },

    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "案例：一个定向井段的滑动优化",
      "lead": [
        "目标：在保证**靶区命中**的前提下，把定向段的滑动占比从 30% 降到 20% 以下。",
        "注意这不是"打得准"的问题，而是"用多少次纠偏换来的准"的问题。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        ["井段", "1200—2100 m"],
        ["滑动占比", "30% → 19%"],
        ["靶区偏差", "≤ 8 m"],
        ["DLS 上限", "3°/30m"]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "测斜数据校正",
          "role": "工程环节",
          "do": "把测斜数据按井深对齐，剔除明显异常点，统一到同一套坐标与深度基准。",
          "effect": "得到可信的姿态序列",
          "trap": "测点稀疏时，一个异常点会被插值放大成整段偏移——**测斜只有几十个点，一个坏点就能毁掉整段轨迹**"
        },
        {
          "name": "轨迹插值与不确定性",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "用最小曲率法插值，同时给出每个位置的置信区间，而不是一条确定的线。",
          "effect": "知道"轨迹可能在哪个范围里"",
          "trap": "把插值结果当成真值，后续所有控制决策都建立在错误的位置上"
        },
        {
          "name": "地层响应辨识",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "从历史滑动记录里学"工具面 → 实际造斜率"的映射，并按井段分开建模。",
          "effect": "知道这一柱滑下去会拐多少",
          "trap": "用一口井的响应去指导另一口井——地层一变，响应曲线就整体平移"
        },
        {
          "name": "滚动优化求解",
          "role": "效果关键",
          "do": "在 DLS 与靶区约束下，求未来 3—5 个立柱的最优工具面与滑动长度，**只执行第一个**。",
          "effect": "每柱都能纠偏，而不是一次算到底",
          "trap": "一次算完整口井，中途地层一变全部作废——开环就是这个结局"
        },
        {
          "name": "建议下发与人工执行",
          "role": "闭环",
          "do": "把工具面角与滑动长度以司钻能读的形式下发，并记录实际执行与偏差。",
          "effect": "把执行偏差变成下一轮的输入",
          "trap": "下发一张曲线图，司钻无法照着操作——**输出必须是可执行的数**"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "五步要点：每一步产出什么、验收什么",
        "html": "<p>下面五张图对应上面五步。第 2 步和第 4 步是这个案例的分水岭：<b>一个决定"你在哪"，一个决定"还能改多少"</b>。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第一步 测斜校正'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 01 · 测斜校正 · 一个坏点能毁掉整段</text><line x1='30' y1='92' x2='600' y2='92' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><path d='M80 62 L180 54 L280 48 L380 40 L480 34 L580 28' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3' stroke-opacity='.8'/><path d='M80 62 L180 54 L280 48 L380 74 L480 34 L580 28' fill='none' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='80' cy='62' r='3' fill='#4d565b'/><circle cx='180' cy='54' r='3' fill='#4d565b'/><circle cx='280' cy='48' r='3' fill='#4d565b'/><circle cx='380' cy='74' r='4' fill='#b05a51'/><circle cx='480' cy='34' r='3' fill='#4d565b'/><circle cx='580' cy='28' r='3' fill='#4d565b'/><text x='380' y='90' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>坏点</text><text x='180' y='82' font-size='7.6' fill='#b26a39'>插值被拉偏</text><text x='80' y='44' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9'>测点</text><text x='600' y='106' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end'>验收：异常点剔除后，相邻测点的曲率不出现突变</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第二步 插值与不确定性'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 02 · 插值与不确定性 · 给区间，不给一条线</text><rect x='4' y='22' width='292' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='16' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 单条曲线</text><path d='M24 88 C 80 58 140 46 288 34' fill='none' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='16' y='100' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>看起来确定，其实是猜的</text><rect x='308' y='22' width='308' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='320' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 带区间</text><path d='M328 88 C 384 58 444 46 604 34 L604 52 C 444 64 384 76 328 98 Z' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.13'/><path d='M328 88 C 384 58 444 46 604 34' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.5'/><path d='M328 98 C 384 76 444 64 604 52' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3' stroke-opacity='.7'/><text x='452' y='64' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51'>区间越往下越宽</text><text x='320' y='100' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>控制决策应该基于区间</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第三步 地层响应辨识'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 03 · 响应辨识 · 同一工具面，两条响应曲线</text><line x1='90' y1='96' x2='560' y2='96' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><line x1='90' y1='96' x2='90' y2='24' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><circle cx='148' cy='88' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='208' cy='78' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='268' cy='70' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='328' cy='62' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='388' cy='54' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='448' cy='46' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='148' cy='72' r='2.6' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='208' cy='56' r='2.6' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='268' cy='42' r='2.6' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='328' cy='34' r='2.6' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.75'/><circle cx='388' cy='28' r='2.6' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.75'/><text x='560' y='110' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>工具面有效分量 →</text><text x='82' y='30' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>造斜率</text><text x='470' y='60' font-size='7.8' fill='#2f7d6b' font-weight='600'>井段 A</text><text x='470' y='36' font-size='7.8' fill='#b26a39' font-weight='600'>井段 B</text><text x='90' y='20' font-size='7.8' fill='#4d565b'>散得越开，越说明必须按井段分开建模</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第四步 滚动优化'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 04 · 滚动优化 · 预测段永远只执行第一步</text><line x1='60' y1='92' x2='600' y2='92' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><path d='M60 84 L160 70 L260 54' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.8'/><path d='M260 54 L360 40 L460 32 L560 28' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><circle cx='60' cy='84' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b'/><circle cx='160' cy='70' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b'/><circle cx='260' cy='54' r='3.6' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='260' y='44' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>当前</text><rect x='262' y='98' width='96' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='310' y='107' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' text-anchor='middle'>只执行首段</text><text x='60' y='24' font-size='7.8' fill='#4d565b'>实线 = 已钻 · 虚线 = 本次预测</text><text x='600' y='110' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end'>下一柱用实测姿态重算，预测作废</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第五步 建议下发'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 05 · 建议下发 · 输出必须是可执行的数</text><rect x='0' y='22' width='252' height='74' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='12' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>输入</text><text x='12' y='54' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b'>靶区坐标</text><text x='12' y='68' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b'>当前姿态（含区间）</text><text x='12' y='82' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b'>DLS 余量 / 工具上限</text><path d='M262 58 h36' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.4'/><path d='M298 58 l-6-3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><text x='280' y='50' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>每柱</text><rect x='310' y='22' width='310' height='74' rx='7' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='322' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>输出（可执行）</text><text x='322' y='56' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>工具面 52°　滑动 6.8 m</text><text x='322' y='72' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>预计造斜 1.4°</text><text x='322' y='88' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>不是"建议加滑动"这种话</text><text x='0' y='110' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：司钻能直接照着执行，执行偏差可回填</text></svg><p style='margin-top:14px'><b>怎么算"控得好"</b></p><table class='dtable'><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>定义</th><th>本例取值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>靶区偏差</td><td>实钻轨迹到靶区中心的距离</td><td>6.2 m</td></tr><tr><td>滑动占比</td><td>滑动进尺 / 总进尺</td><td>19%</td></tr><tr><td>最大狗腿度</td><td>单位井段的角度变化</td><td>2.6° / 30m</td></tr><tr><td>预测偏差</td><td>预测造斜率与实际的差</td><td>0.23°</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin-top:12px'>不能只看最终落点，要把<b>滑动占比</b>（成本）和<b>狗腿度</b>（副作用）一起看。<b>打得准但全是滑动，等于用钻时买精度</b>。</p>"
      },
      "fails": [
        { "name": "把地层当成常数", "why": "同一工具面在砂岩与泥岩里造斜率不同。解决方向：按井段/岩性分段辨识响应，而不是全井一个模型。" },
        { "name": "忽略执行偏差", "why": "实际滑动长度与建议不符，模型却按建议更新状态，误差越滚越大。解决方向：用实测姿态而非建议姿态做状态更新。" },
        { "name": "过度纠偏", "why": "每柱追求零偏差，导致轨迹锯齿、摩阻上升。解决方向：把 DLS 作为惩罚项，接受靶区内的偏差。" }
      ]
    },

